    <p>
        Every tool is also a <code>GET</code> under <code>/api/mcp/...</code>: open one in a browser tab to read
        exactly what an agent is handed.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/SearchBonboarding?query=advance%20when%20the%20user%20clicks" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/SearchBonboarding?query=advance when the user clicks</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBonboardingApi?typeName=BonboardingStep" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBonboardingApi?typeName=BonboardingStep</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBonboardingThemeVariables" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBonboardingThemeVariables</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/InspectBonboardingPlacement?targetX=1200&amp;targetY=20&amp;targetWidth=60&amp;targetHeight=30&amp;placement=Right" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/InspectBonboardingPlacement?targetX=1200&amp;targetY=20&amp;targetWidth=60&amp;targetHeight=30&amp;placement=Right</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBonboardingSourceFile?path=Demo/Client/Pages/Flows.razor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBonboardingSourceFile?path=Demo/Client/Pages/Flows.razor</a></li>
    </ul>
</section>

